{"1351140": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "KAPIA", "steam_appid": 1351140, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [1879470], "detailed_description": "<h1>Funded on Kickstarter</h1><p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An artificial intelligence known as The Eye watches over every citizen of the dome city KAPIA.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When retired pilot Stefan disappears after uncovering evidence that could change the fate of the world, his granddaughter Reny sets out to find him.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as both characters, solve puzzles, uncover conspiracies, and discover the truth behind the war that forced humanity beneath the dome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1351140/extras/4c4fe498d15e0317e113c9cd9d8ee22e.poster.avif?t=1781170487\" width=600 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1351140/extras/4c4fe498d15e0317e113c9cd9d8ee22e.webm?t=1781170487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1351140/extras/4c4fe498d15e0317e113c9cd9d8ee22e.mp4?t=1781170487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Controller or Point-and-click</strong>A traditional point and click flow with an easily accessible drop-down inventory. To make things more exciting we also added a first-person close-up menu where you can interact with various items.  <br>Or play KAPIA with your controller and enjoy a modern game flow from your couch.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play for both characters</strong>People have different sides to them, and the same goes for characters in KAPIA. Discover the story from different perspectives as you play for both Stefan and Reny. Follow their own unique paths to achieve a common goal.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1351140/extras/32bb35a120842bec1440543d5555cbfd.poster.avif?t=1781170487\" width=600 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1351140/extras/32bb35a120842bec1440543d5555cbfd.webm?t=1781170487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1351140/extras/32bb35a120842bec1440543d5555cbfd.mp4?t=1781170487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique 3D design</strong>Enjoy a carefully crafted environment of medieval architecture and futuristic gadgets. Intelligent robots walk the streets of manually carved stone, power banks light up antique lamps, and typewriters serve as input devices for powerful computers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzles and mini-games</strong>Logic and diversity was the key to our work on this most significant aspect of the game. Just like in traditional adventure game most puzzles are tied up with objects, but there are also conversational puzzles and a whole bunch of logical mini-games.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "A mystery adventure about propaganda, surveillance and AI control, seen through the eyes of a grandfather and granddaughter.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Russian, Dutch<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "reviews": "“To conclude, KAPIA is a very good point &amp; click, worthy of the great classics.”<br>9/10 – Couple of Gamer<br><br>“KAPIA is actually a very fun and engaging point &amp; click adventure.”<br>8/10 – Gaming Euphoria<br><br>“Beautiful visually, with empathy having the first say!”<br>9/10 – Joystick<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1351140/header.jpg?t=1781170487", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1351140/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1781170487", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1351140/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1781170487", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 or above<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-2100 (3.1GHz) or AMD Phenom X4 945 (3.0GHz)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce GTX 650 2GB or AMD Radeon HD 7770 2GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 15 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 or above<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 3470, (3.20 Ghz) or AMD FX-8350, (4.00 Ghz)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 6 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce GTX 970 4GB or AMD Radeon R9 280X 3GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 15 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "developers": ["2 FOR 2"], "publishers": ["2 FOR 2"], "demos": [{"appid": 1408520, "description": "KAPIA Demo"}], "price_overview": {"currency": "USD", "initial": 1999, "final"